> [c655a69](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36521/changes/c655a696d8d1013bf61b815ba7b477840d31765c) _p2p: limit the weight of transactions and blocks while deserializing_:

What if we used a 33-byte compressed public key alongside the 72-byte signature in the P2WPKH benchmark instead?
For two inputs and two outputs, that changes each transaction from 912 to 834 WU, so 4,795 fit instead of 4,385.

